  "description": "MoodTrip is an AI-powered hotel search that understands natural language. Instead of clicking through dozens of filters, simply describe your ideal stay: \"boutique hotel in Tokyo for 2 adults, December 10-15, under $200/night.\" MoodTrip interprets your request, searches real-time availability across thousands of properties, and returns hotels with:\n\nLive pricing and availability\nHotel photos and ratings\nDirect booking links\nSmart constraint relaxation when results are limited\nPerfect for travelers who know what they want but hate the traditional search process.",
